      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Where did this fog come from? I can’t see a thing!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Fog and darkness cloud this place, but we can use it to our advantage. The other ships will be safe hidden out in the deep water."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("We should find a fort before we land the rest of our people. I do not like the idea of landing everyone without a fort to protect us. Shrouded by the fog, they will be safe for the moment. Once we find a place to rally our people, we can bring the rest of them in and start fighting in earnest."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I think there were some human ruins in the southwestern part of the island. If you explore the land to the west, then we will swim through the shallows and see what we can find."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("That is a good plan. First find a fort, then we can explore the rest of the island."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "merfolk_units",
            kill: "yes",
            side: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 2,
            cells: "8-29,38-45",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "jungle_warning",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "30-35",
            y: "31-36",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Indeed. It seems much more open to the south. The merfolk mentioned that there were human ruins to the southwest. Maybe we should explore there first. I don’t think I want to hack through the jungle until we have more elves at our side."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "jungle_warning_2",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22terrain%22%3A%22*%5EF*%2C*%5ETf*%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The trees themselves seem against my presence here. They give me an ominous feeling as if something bad is going to happen if I stay here."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "0-26",
            y: "36-40",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I don’t get it. All we see are ruins, bones, some sand and patches of grass. I thought we would be attacked the moment we set foot on this island. Where is everybody?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("That’s what worries me. I keep thinking that something is going to jump out from behind the next rock or stone wall and attack, but everything is silent. Too silent."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_sighted_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Boyicht%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_seer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Boyicht",
            text: _("You trespass on holy ground, The One says you must die!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Faugh! Little one, you are not worth our time. We are the Quenoth Elves! Flee and trouble us no longer or we will squash you like a bug."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Boyicht",
            text: _("No, you are not The One. You no command Boyicht. Attack!"),
          },
